<b>🎵 Lidarr</b> · <font color="#3498db">✏️ Renamed</font>
<ul>
<li><b>Artist:</b> {{ trigger.payload_json.artist.name | default('—') }}</li>
<li><b>Files renamed:</b> {{ trigger.payload_json.renamedTrackFiles | length }}</li>
